# hunks:
#   API-36: `PopoverContent` takes `size` (`default` · `md` · `lg` · `fit`) and forwards `anchor` to the
#     Positioner (an element or a virtual one, read in the window's coordinates); `PopoverBody`
#     scrolls long content; `PopoverAnchor` is an invisible 0×0 trigger; `PopoverDescription`
