#     INSIDE the portal — the same host shape `select`, `combobox` and `tooltip` carry.
#     `tooling/verify-portal-theme-scope.mjs` inventories this host.
#   BRD-1: `PopoverContent` draws a real 1px `border border-border` instead of upstream's
#     `ring-1 ring-foreground/10` box-shadow outline (MK reversed BRD-1 to ours, 23-09-2026). A
#     border survives forced colours and matches `foundations/elevation`; nothing else moves.
#   LAY-17 (MK 2026-10-13, Regent long-names review): `PopoverContent` sets `wrap-break-word`,
#     so a long unbroken word breaks inside the popover rather than running past its edge.
#   cn: `import { cn } from "cn"` becomes `@vegastack/design` — our npm layer owns `cn` (DOC-2).
#   formatting: prettier reflow plus the `registry-stamp.mjs` provenance header (DOC-1); no
#               decision of their own.
